OL,3,AEx-Deutsche Bank trader jailed for
OL,4,Arigging rates has conviction overturned
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother former banker sentenced in one
OL,7,Fof the biggest scandals of the
OL,8,Ffinancial crisis has had his conviction
OL,9,Foverturned following a long-running
OL,10,Flegal battle.
OL,12,FThe Court of Appeal has quashed the
OL,13,Fconviction of Christian Bittar, a
OL,14,Fformer Deutsche Bank trader who went to
OL,15,Fprison in 2018 for "manipulating" the
OL,16,Fbenchmark interest rate, Euribor.
OL,18,FIt comes after the same UK court
OL,19,Foverturned five convictions of
OL,20,Fex-Barclays bankers in the rate rigging
OL,21,Ftrials earlier this week.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,108,105,200,300,0,100
