OL,3,AEx-Deutsche Bank trader jailed for
OL,4,Arigging rates has conviction overturned
OL,5,
OL,6,FBittar, who watched proceedings via
OL,7,Fvideo link from Switzerland because he
OL,8,Fwas not granted a visa to attend court,
OL,9,Ftold the BBC: "I have waited a very,
OL,10,Fvery long time for this day."
